gh is is everything's real I  mean there's no breakaway glass or it's  so safe of course but you know  everything that you see happen me and  Jake actually did which which was  craziness kind of thing you never think  you're gonna be standing on one side of  a room and somebody's gonna tell you to  just throw a crowbar into a TV but it  happened and and you know the song  actually it's sung by M ward that was we  actually played that through the house  as well  demolishing it so that definitely played  a huge role well thank you all for  joining us tonight  and thank you for thank you thanks thank  you for coming

